    {
      "id": "u_62f481a6ddc256c9d8bda63f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A Note map is a note type which displays a standalone version of the feature of the same name: __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Map (Link map, Tree map)__TRILIUM_PH_1__. Consult that page for more information on how the note map works and what it displays.",
      "sourceHash": "62f481a6ddc256c9d8bda63f5c921a6f884335356108af2075d93ffd580c662a",
      "context": "Note Map",
      "contextHash": "e596c34ead1043f9f6ec5b9e4c7f4b2b4f5885d35f0117178931772a9866ee85",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2cc929a68281b5217942a8af_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once created, the note map will display the relations between notes. Only the notes that are part of the parent of the note map will be displayed (including their children).",
      "sourceHash": "2cc929a68281b5217942a8af4a2e628e5093b6a972b694af3d99271dff8e44cd",
      "context": "Note Map",
